## **Device Changelog** ##

**marble (01/01/2025)**

```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Update common blobs from diting V816.0.9.0.ULFMIXM
- Update marble blobs, firmware and fingerprint from V816.0.12.0.UMRMIXM
- Set frame rate multiple threshold to 120Hz
- Move to new xiaomi touch (touch freeze should be fixed now)
- Address missing libbinder symbols in libwfdnative
- Bump libwfdservice to android.media.audio.common.types-V4
- AIDL fingerprint improvements
- Added basic call recorder
- Misc improvements
```

**marble (18/11/2024)**

```bash
- Initial Release
- Upstream kernel
- Updated common blobs from diting V816.0.8.0.ULFMIXM
- Updated marble blobs from V816.0.10.0.UMRMIXM
- Switched fingerprint, USB & thermal HALs to AIDL
- Migrate sensor HAL to AIDL interface
- Add v2 suffix to sensors.xiaomi
- Move to Xiaomi IR AIDL
- Shim WFD with libgui_shim/libinput_shim
- Add missing displayconfig for 0b panel
- Get rid of 32 bit blobs
- Misc. Improvements
```
